# 0241 = 0240 + TX liveness retry.  push_log returned before the doorbell
#   when no new data was queued, so a stalled TX queue (inf=9, tq=0) was
#   never retried.  With inflight>0, keep calling resume/restart (20 ms
#   gate inside) so the 5 ms kick revives it.
